$ botmap types
address
  theme: addresses
  Address point with street, number, postcode, country code.

bathymetry
  theme: base
  Underwater terrain features.

building
  theme: buildings
  Building footprint with height, floor count, class, subtype.

building_part
  theme: buildings
  Sub-component of a building when it has variable height/material.

connector
  theme: transportation
  Junction or endpoint where segments meet.

division
  theme: divisions
  Point representation of an administrative division (country, region, locality...).

division_area
  theme: divisions
  Polygon area for a division.

division_boundary
  theme: divisions
  Linear boundary between divisions.

infrastructure
  theme: base
  Linear or point infrastructure features (bridges, tunnels, towers, etc.).

land
  theme: base
  Natural land features (forest, beach, glacier, etc.).

land_cover
  theme: base
  Land cover surface (forest, grassland, water, etc.).

land_use
  theme: base
  Predominant human use of an area (commercial, residential, recreation, etc.).

place
  theme: places
  Categorized POI with names, brand, categories, contact info.

segment
  theme: transportation
  Road or rail segment with class, subclass, surface, speed limits.

water
  theme: base
  Water bodies (river, lake, ocean).

[exit=0]

$ botmap themes
addresses
  Address features with street, number, postcode, and country.
  types: address

base
  Base layers: land, water, land use/cover, infrastructure, bathymetry.
  types: bathymetry, infrastructure, land, land_cover, land_use, water

buildings
  Building footprints with height, floors, class, and roof attributes.
  types: building, building_part

divisions
  Administrative divisions (countries, regions, counties, localities) and their polygons.
  types: division, division_area, division_boundary

places
  Categorized point features for businesses, services, and amenities (POIs).
  types: place

transportation
  Road network as segments with class, surface, speed limits, and connector junctions.
  types: connector, segment

