────────── botmap addresses --help ──────────
Usage: botmap addresses [OPTIONS]

  Find addresses in a named place or bbox.

  --street uses case-insensitive substring match ("Fountain" matches "Fountain
  St", "Fountain Ave", "E Fountain Blvd"). --number and --postcode are exact.
  For other fields, use --where.

  Requires --in or --bbox to keep queries bounded; the global address dataset
  is too large to scan unfiltered.

Options:
  --in TEXT                       Resolve a place name to a bbox via the
                                  divisions index.
  --bbox BBOX                     Bounding box xmin,ymin,xmax,ymax. Mutually
                                  exclusive with --in.
  --street TEXT                   Street name (case-insensitive substring).
                                  Example: --street Fountain
  --number TEXT                   House/building number (exact match; field is
                                  a string, so "1208" or "1208A").
  --postcode TEXT                 Postal code (exact match).
  --where TEXT
  -n, --limit INTEGER             Maximum number of features to emit (default:
                                  all matches).
  -f [geojson|geojsonseq|geoparquet]
                                  [default: geojsonseq]
  -o, --output PATH
  -r, --release TEXT
  --help                          Show this message and exit.

────────── botmap at --help ──────────
Usage: botmap at [OPTIONS] LATLON

  Nearest-neighbor lookup. LATLON is 'LAT,LON' (lat first, geographic).

Options:
  -t, --type [address|bathymetry|building|building_part|division|division_area|division_boundary|place|segment|connector|infrastructure|land|land_cover|land_use|water]
                                  [default: place]
  -n INTEGER                      [default: 10]
  -r, --radius INTEGER            Radius in meters; defaults per type.
  --where TEXT                    Attribute filter K OP V (repeatable).
                                  Example: --where
                                  categories.primary=coffee_shop
  -f [geojson|geojsonseq|geoparquet]
                                  [default: geojsonseq]
  -o, --output PATH
  --release TEXT
  --help                          Show this message and exit.

────────── botmap containing --help ──────────
Usage: botmap containing [OPTIONS] LATLON

  Which divisions contain this point? Innermost (highest admin_level) first.

Options:
  --help  Show this message and exit.

